## Content detection (`file`)

`magic.txt` is a libmagic pattern.

```sh
file --magic-file magic.txt yourfile{{ dotted_ext }}
cat magic.txt >> ~/.magic && file --compile ~/.magic   # install for your user
```
{% if not has_magic %}
The spec declares no magic bytes, so the pattern is a comment explaining why.
Add `magic = "…"` to `[format]` and regenerate.
{% endif %}
